Opus 1.3.1 (https://opus-codec.org, git tag v1.3.1), unmodified, for the Xeno Crisis music decoder in firmware.stm
(see ../build.sh, which applies ../m4_exact.patch to a temporary copy at build time). Only the parts that build uses
are here: celt/, silk/, src/, include/ without tests, demos, float and x86/MIPS/NEON code. License: COPYING (BSD).
